---
import { InstagramIcon, TikTokIcon, SpotifyIcon } from '@/components/ui/SocialIcons';
---

<footer class="w-full px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto pb-12 pt-6">
  <div class="bg-white rounded-card p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-14 cushion-card border border-pink-100/80">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 pb-10 border-b border-pink-100">
      {/* Brand & Social Column (4 cols) */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-4">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3 group inline-flex">
          <img
            src="/logogirlsandlaw.webp"
            alt="Girls & Law Logo"
            width="48"
            height="48"
            class="w-12 h-12 object-contain rounded-full transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:scale-105"
          />
          <div class="flex flex-col">
            <span class="font-serif font-black text-xl text-ink leading-tight">
              Girls <span class="text-[#E31B6D] italic">&amp;</span> Law
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black tracking-[0.2em] text-[#E31B6D] uppercase leading-none">
              Masterclass 2026
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <p class="text-sm font-bold text-muted max-w-sm leading-relaxed font-pouf">
          Redefiniendo el ejercicio jurídico desde la autenticidad, la excelencia procesal y la sororidad. Formando a la nueva generación de juristas líderes.
        </p>

        {/* 1st-Pouf Clay Social Blobs */}
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-2">
          <a
            href="https://instagram.com/girlsandlaw"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            aria-label="Instagram de Girls and Law"
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-blob bg-pink text-ink cushion-control active:cushion-control-active active:translate-y-[2px] transition-all hover:scale-105 flex items-center justify-center group"
          >
            <InstagramIcon className="w-4 h-4 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110" />
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://tiktok.com/@girlsandlaw"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            aria-label="TikTok de Girls and Law"
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-blob bg-yellow text-ink cushion-control active:cushion-control-active active:translate-y-[2px] transition-all hover:scale-105 flex items-center justify-center group"
          >
            <TikTokIcon className="w-4 h-4 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110" />
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://spotify.com"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            aria-label="Spotify de Girls and Law"
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-blob bg-mint text-ink cushion-control active:cushion-control-active active:translate-y-[2px] transition-all hover:scale-105 flex items-center justify-center group"
          >
            <SpotifyIcon className="w-4 h-4 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Nav Column 1: Masterclass (3 cols) */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-[#E31B6D]">
          Masterclass
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm font-bold text-muted font-pouf">
          <li>
            <a href="#trailer" class="hover:text-ink hover:underline transition-colors">
              Trailer &amp; Muestra 4K
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#metodologia" class="hover:text-ink hover:underline transition-colors">
              Metodología Clínica
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#temario" class="hover:text-ink hover:underline transition-colors">
              Plan de Estudios (4 Módulos)
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#fundadora" class="hover:text-ink hover:underline transition-colors">
              Roxana Rivera &amp; Visión
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#precios" class="hover:text-ink hover:underline transition-colors">
              Inversión &amp; Admisión VIP
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#faq" class="hover:text-ink hover:underline transition-colors">
              Preguntas Frecuentes
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Nav Column 2: Comunidad & Vault (2 cols) */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-[#E31B6D]">
          Ecosistema
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm font-bold text-muted font-pouf">
          <li>
            <a href="#metodologia" class="hover:text-ink hover:underline transition-colors">
              El Vault Procesal
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#fundadora" class="hover:text-ink hover:underline transition-colors">
              Comunidad de Egresadas
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="mailto:contacto@girlsandlaw.com" class="hover:text-ink hover:underline transition-colors">
              Alianzas &amp; Universidades
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="mailto:soporte@girlsandlaw.com" class="hover:text-ink hover:underline transition-colors">
              Mesa de Ayuda
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Newsletter Box (3 cols) */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-3">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-control bg-[#FFF5F9] cushion-row space-y-3">
          <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-pill text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider bg-pink text-ink">
            Newsletter Semanal
          </span>
          <h5 class="text-xs font-black text-ink font-pouf">
            Estrategia procesal y consejos directos a tu bandeja.
          </h5>
          <form class="space-y-2" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('¡Gracias por suscribirte al boletín de Girls & Law!');">
            <input
              type="email"
              placeholder="tu@correo.com"
              required
              class="w-full text-xs font-bold px-3 py-2 rounded-control bg-white text-ink placeholder:text-muted/60 cushion-field outline-none focus:cushion-field-focus transition-all"
            />
            <button
              type="submit"
              class="w-full text-xs font-black py-2 px-3 rounded-control bg-pink text-ink cushion-control active:cushion-control-active active:translate-y-[1px] cursor-pointer transition-all hover:bg-[#FF9EC4]"
            >
              Suscribirme Gratis
            </button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Bottom Bar with 1st-Pouf Pill */}
    <div class="pt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs font-bold text-muted">
      <p>© 2026 Girls &amp; Law. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-pill bg-[#FFF5F9] border border-pink-100 text-[11px] font-black text-ink">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-mint"></span>
          Inscripciones abiertas · Edición 2026
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
